ify-center shrink-0"><i class="w-7 h-7" data-lucide="lightbulb"></i></div><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-sky-700 uppercase tracking-wider block">Tips Belajar &amp; Metakognisi</span><h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 truncate mb-0.5">Teknik Pengelolaan Waktu &amp; Persiapan Ujian</h3><p class="text-xs text-slate-500 line-clamp-1">Membangun kebiasaan fokus tinggi untuk tugas proyek dan praktikum laboratorium.</p></div><i class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 shrink-0" data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-4" id="faq"><div class="mb-2"><span class="text-xs font-bold text-pcr-red uppercase tracking-wider block">Tanya Jawab</span><h2 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-pcr-teal">Pertanyaan Sering Diajukan (FAQ)</h2></div><div class="space-y-3"><details class="group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-4 [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer font-heading font-bold text-sm text-slate-800"><span>Bagaimana cara mendaftar akun di Sistem BK PCR?</span><i class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" data-lucide="chevron-down"></i></summary><p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 mt-2.5 pt-2.5 border-t border-slate-100 leading-relaxed">Akun siswa dan data kelas didaftarkan secara tersentral melalui operator sekolah atau Admin sistem. Untuk Guru BK baru, proses registrasi akun memerlukan approval dari pihak berwenang sebelum modul layanan dapat dioperasikan penuh.</p></details><details class="group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-4 [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer font-heading font-bold text-sm text-slate-800"><span>Apakah isi obrolan &amp; catatan konseling bersifat rahasia?</span><i class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" data-lucide="chevron-d